    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "q_discount": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who can use the first-order discount?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Anyone who hasn't ordered film processing from us. It takes $20 off $50 or more of processing, once per customer, and doesn't cover shipping or add-ons. The cards at the top of this page add the code for you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q_film": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What film can you develop?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>C-41 color and black &amp; white, from 35mm and disposables to 120, 110 and APS. We no longer process E-6 or ECN-2.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q_pack": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How should I pack it?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Rolls in a sealed Ziploc, then a padded mailer or small box, not a paper envelope. Put a slip with your name and order number inside.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q_negs": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I get my negatives back?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>If you want them. When you order, choose rolled up (free), standard sleeves ($1) or archival sleeves ($3) for each roll. Or choose discard and skip return shipping.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q_time": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does it take?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>The average at the top of this page is live, counted in calendar days (weekends included) from when we check in your film. Add the time your package spends in the mail each way.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q_lost": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if my film gets lost in the mail?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>It's rare. If your film never reaches us, we refund your order in full, including the label. We can't replace the film itself, so pack carefully and keep your tracking number.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
